  "description": "Take the bike trail to task with a ride that is versatile as it is capable. Meet Motley: a rugged hybrid bike built to get you from point A to point B… then all the way to point Z and back again, with the benefit of 21 speeds and super shock-absorbent Zoom suspension fork and saddle. Motley’s Kenda Kwest performance tires will rise to any occasion with their semi slick tread and water dispersion grooves, giving you the ability to ride in just about any environment. Since we know you’re going the distance with this bike, we made sure to go the extra mile for you by decking Motley out with a super-comfort saddle, suspension seat post, twist grip shifters, ergonomic brake levers and a sturdy rear mount kickstand. Equipped with name brand components such as a Shimano Altus 21 speed drivetrain and Megarange gearing, this bike allows for fast and effortless gear changes, improving the quality of your commute, fitness, or weekend ride ten-fold.",
